WEBVTT

00:02:29.413 --> 00:02:30.996
In this show. I take you inside

00:02:30.996 --> 00:02:34.454
the minds of fascinating people to
help us rethink how we work,

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:40.329
lead and live today, why we get trapped
in bad decisions and how you

00:02:40.538 --> 00:02:42.579
and your workplace can get unstuck.

00:02:43.996 --> 00:02:46.621
Thanks to Morgan Stanley for
sponsoring this episode.

00:02:49.621 --> 00:02:50.954
Let's start from the beginning.

00:02:51.496 --> 00:02:58.496
My father was one of the very earliest
people who started a discount store

00:02:58.829 --> 00:03:02.163
and it was very successful and
he started a second one on